<title>SOUTH AFRICA: IBCA re-affirms Saambou domestic ratings.</title>
<headline>IBCA re-affirms Saambou domestic ratings.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>International rating agency IBCA on Monday re-affirmed the short-term A2 domestic rating of Saambou Holdings Ltd and the short-term A2 domestic rating and BBB+ long-term domestic rating of Saambou Bank Ltd.</p>
<p>The agency said in a statement it also re-affirmed the Saambou Bank's legal &quot;4&quot; rating.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
